agents render — Render client-native configuration or prompt

USAGE
  agents render [options]

OPTIONS
  -file string
    	path to harness-policy.toml or agents.toml
  -harness string
    	target client harness (claude, antigravity, copilot, codex, pi, opencode)
  -os string
    	target operating system (darwin, linux, windows)
  -part string
    	output granularity (permissions, settings, prompt, all)
  -profile string
    	optional configuration profile to apply
  -h, --help
    Show this help and exit.

DEFAULTS
  -part defaults to settings; -os defaults to the host operating system. Output goes to stdout.

ENVIRONMENT
  AGENTS_CONFIG, CHEZMOI_SOURCE_DIR, HOME: configuration discovery.

EXAMPLES
  agents render -harness pi -os linux
